WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:02.982
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.875
- [Narrator] Please draw
a cute cat on the box

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:14.141
with a speech bubble, saying howdy.

00:00:14.141 --> 00:00:16.693
I would like it to be
wearing a cowboy hat.

00:00:16.693 --> 00:00:20.406
I will tip $10 for listening
to my ridiculous requests.

00:00:20.406 --> 00:00:22.045
(cat purrs)

00:00:22.045 --> 00:00:24.171
- [Narrator] This is for Butters the pug.

00:00:24.171 --> 00:00:26.606
You know he's a baller,
and he want's his (bleep).

00:00:26.606 --> 00:00:28.085
I'd like an extra turkey patty

00:00:28.085 --> 00:00:30.680
and five strips of bacon, no bun.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.324
Home pug needs his meat.

00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:36.376
- [Narrator] Can you please
spell congrats in pepperonis?

00:00:36.376 --> 00:00:39.229
If the pepperonis don't fit,
then use jalapenos instead.

00:00:39.229 --> 00:00:41.334
Can you please also include
a note with the delivery

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:43.585
that says congratulations on your new job?

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:44.952
Who cares if others get mad,

00:00:44.952 --> 00:00:48.327
you won't have to see
their faces ever again.

00:00:48.327 --> 00:00:49.944
- [Narrator] Last time,
you guys killed it,

00:00:49.944 --> 00:00:51.368
absolutely awesome salad.

00:00:51.368 --> 00:00:53.311
I want you to murder
that salad with croutons

00:00:53.311 --> 00:00:54.527
and parmesan cheese.

00:00:54.527 --> 00:00:56.409
Like, I want it to be offensive to people

00:00:56.409 --> 00:00:58.070
that don't like croutons and cheese,

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:59.887
as much as you love to throw on there.

00:00:59.887 --> 00:01:01.833
Have people look at that and be like whoa,

00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:03.669
is that a salad with croutons,

00:01:03.669 --> 00:01:05.586
or croutons with salad?

00:01:06.776 --> 00:01:07.785
- [Narrator] I don't know Rick,

00:01:07.785 --> 00:01:09.541
does sunny side up mean over hard?

00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:12.698
Look here Morty, these here
breakfast people understand

00:01:12.698 --> 00:01:14.130
the nature of their eggs.

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:16.745
If you just tell them you want over,

00:01:16.745 --> 00:01:19.875
maybe you'd stop being such
a worthless piece of (bleep).

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:23.587
Jeez Rick, no need to be a jerk about it.

00:01:23.587 --> 00:01:25.354
- [Narrator] I just want the
cheese with the (bleep) beef,

00:01:25.354 --> 00:01:26.784
sour cream, and lettuce, that's it.

00:01:26.784 --> 00:01:28.578
So, if you could, could
I just get that dubs

00:01:28.578 --> 00:01:30.928
since I'm not getting the
salsa, jalapenos, and onions?

00:01:30.928 --> 00:01:32.101
I'd greatly appreciate it,

00:01:32.101 --> 00:01:33.787
and since I've ordered
from you guys a lot,

00:01:33.787 --> 00:01:36.872
so has my boyfriend, 'cause
you guys are the (bleep).

00:01:36.872 --> 00:01:39.455
(upbeat music)

